{"id":"pipeline-refactor","title":"Collapse the temporaries","difficulty":"core","chapter":"ranges","topics":["ranges","views","algorithms"],"standard":"c++20","check":"unit","stdin":"","cases":[],"timeLimitMs":0,"promptHtml":"<p>Write <code>long_words_upper</code> as a single ranges pipeline: the words longer than\nthree characters, uppercased, in their original order.</p>\n<p>Do it without intermediate containers — one pipeline, materialised exactly once\nat the end. The version with two <code>std::vector</code> temporaries also works, and the\nnotes show it; the point of this problem is the pipeline.</p>\n","starter":"#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\nstd::vector<std::string> long_words_upper(const std::vector<std::string>& words) {\n    return {};\n}","tests":"{\n    std::vector<std::string> words{\"a\", \"tree\", \"of\", \"green\", \"sky\"};\n    auto result = long_words_upper(words);\n    CHECK_EQ(result.size(), std::size_t{2});\n    CHECK_EQ(result[0], std::string(\"TREE\"));\n    CHECK_EQ(result[1], std::string(\"GREEN\"));\n}\n{\n    std::vector<std::string> words{\"no\", \"up\", \"at\"};\n    CHECK(long_words_upper(words).empty());\n}\n{\n    std::vector<std::string> words;\n    CHECK(long_words_upper(words).empty());\n}\n{\n    // Exactly four characters counts as longer than three.\n    std::vector<std::string> words{\"abcd\", \"abc\"};\n    auto result = long_words_upper(words);\n    CHECK_EQ(result.size(), std::size_t{1});\n    CHECK_EQ(result[0], std::string(\"ABCD\"));\n}\n{\n    std::vector<std::string> words{\"Mixed\", \"CASE\", \"here\"};\n    auto result = long_words_upper(words);\n    CHECK_EQ(result.size(), std::size_t{3});\n    CHECK_EQ(result[0], std::string(\"MIXED\"));\n    CHECK_EQ(result[2], std::string(\"HERE\"));\n}","hints":["<p><code>words | std::views::filter(pred) | std::views::transform(fn)</code> chains both steps with no temporaries.</p>\n","<p>The transform must return a <code>std::string</code> by value, so take the parameter by value and modify the copy.</p>\n","<p>The parameter is an lvalue reference, so the pipeline holds a reference to it — fine here, because it is materialised before returning.</p>\n","<p>Materialise with <code>std::vector&lt;std::string&gt; result(pipeline.begin(), pipeline.end());</code> and return that, never the view.</p>\n"],"solution":"#include <cctype>\n#include <ranges>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n\nstd::vector<std::string> long_words_upper(const std::vector<std::string>& words) {\n    auto pipeline = words\n                  | std::views::filter([](const std::string& w) { return w.size() > 3; })\n                  | std::views::transform([](std::string w) {\n                        for (char& c : w) c = static_cast<char>(std::toupper(static_cast<unsigned char>(c)));\n                        return w;\n                    });\n\n    return std::vector<std::string>(pipeline.begin(), pipeline.end());\n}","solutionNotesHtml":"<p>Written with algorithms instead, it needs two temporaries and two passes:</p>\n<figure class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--sh-light:#393a34;--sh-dark:#dbd7caee;--sh-light-bg:#ffffff;--sh-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">vector</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">string</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> longer</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">copy_if</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\">words</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">begin</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(),</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\"> words</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">end</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(),</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\"> std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">back_inserter</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">longer</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">             [](</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">const</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\"> std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#2E8F82;--sh-dark:#5DA994\">string</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\"> w</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\"> {</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#1E754F;--sh-dark:#4D9375\"> return</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\"> w</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">size</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">()</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\"> ></span><span style=\"--sh-light:#2F798A;--sh-dark:#4C9A91\"> 3</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">;</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">vector</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">string</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">></span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> upper</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">transform</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\">longer</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">begin</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(),</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\"> longer</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">end</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(),</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\"> std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">back_inserter</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">upper</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">               [](</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#2E8F82;--sh-dark:#5DA994\">string</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#B07D48;--sh-dark:#BD976A\"> w</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#1E754F;--sh-dark:#4D9375\">                   for</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\"> (</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">char&#x26;</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> c </span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">:</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> w</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> c </span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\"> static_cast&#x3C;char></span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">std</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">::</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#59873A;--sh-dark:#80A665\">toupper</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\">static_cast&#x3C;unsigned</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#AB5959;--sh-dark:#CB7676\"> char></span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">c</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#1E754F;--sh-dark:#4D9375\">                   return</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> w</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">               });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--sh-light:#1E754F;--sh-dark:#4D9375\">return</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#393A34;--sh-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> upper</span><span style=\"--sh-light:#999999;--sh-dark:#666666\">;</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>That is correct, and for five words the difference does not matter. It is the\nshape that matters: each additional step adds another container and another\npass, while a pipeline adds neither.</p>\n<p>The materialisation is not optional, and it is not merely about the return type.\nThe pipeline holds a <em>reference</em> to <code>words</code> — the parameter — so returning the\nview itself would hand the caller something whose validity depends on a\nreference the caller cannot see. Building the vector before returning cuts that\ndependency.</p>\n<p>Note the <code>static_cast&lt;unsigned char&gt;</code> inside <code>toupper</code>. It is the same trap as\nin the word-counting problem: <code>std::toupper</code> has undefined behaviour for\nnegative values, and plain <code>char</code> is signed on most platforms, so a byte above\n127 in UTF-8 input would be negative.</p>\n<p>In C++23 the last line becomes\n<code>return words | views::filter(...) | views::transform(...) | std::ranges::to&lt;std::vector&gt;();</code>\nwhich says the same thing without naming the pipeline.</p>\n"}